{"phrasebook":[{"id":"basics","t":"Basics","items":[{"l":"Salam 3likum","a":"السلام عليكم","en":"Peace be upon you (greeting)","fr":"Que la paix soit sur vous (salutation)","es":"La paz sea contigo (saludo)","ar":"السلام عليكم (تحية)","n":2},{"l":"Wa 3alaykum s-salam","a":"وعليكم السلام","en":"And peace be upon you (reply)","fr":"Et sur vous la paix (réponse)","es":"Y contigo la paz (respuesta)","ar":"وعليكم السلام (رد التحية)","n":2},{"l":"Labas?","a":"لاباس؟","en":"How are you? / Is all well?","fr":"Ça va ?","es":"¿Qué tal? / ¿Todo bien?","ar":"كيف حالك؟ هل كل شيء بخير؟","n":2},{"l":"Labas, l-hamdulillah","a":"لاباس الحمد لله","en":"Fine, thank God","fr":"Ça va, Dieu merci","es":"Bien, gracias a Dios","ar":"بخير والحمد لله","n":2},{"l":"Sbah l-khir","a":"صباح الخير","en":"Good morning","fr":"Bonjour (le matin)","es":"Buenos días","ar":"صباح الخير","n":2},{"l":"Msa l-khir","a":"مساء الخير","en":"Good evening","fr":"Bonsoir","es":"Buenas tardes / noches","ar":"مساء الخير","n":2},{"l":"Bslama","a":"بسلامة","en":"Goodbye","fr":"Au revoir","es":"Adiós","ar":"مع السلامة","n":3},{"l":"Shukran","a":"شكرا","en":"Thank you","fr":"Merci","es":"Gracias","ar":"شكرا","n":3},{"l":"3afak","a":"عافاك","en":"Please","fr":"S'il vous plaît","es":"Por favor","ar":"من فضلك","n":3},{"l":"Smeh liya","a":"سمح ليا","en":"Excuse me / sorry","fr":"Excusez-moi / pardon","es":"Disculpa / perdón","ar":"عذرا / آسف","n":2},{"l":"Iyeh","a":"إيه","en":"Yes","fr":"Oui","es":"Sí","ar":"نعم","n":2},{"l":"La","a":"لا","en":"No","fr":"Non","es":"No","ar":"لا","n":2},{"l":"Mashi mushkil","a":"ماشي مشكل","en":"No problem","fr":"Pas de problème","es":"No hay problema","ar":"لا مشكلة","n":2},{"l":"Shnu smitek?","a":"شنو سميتك؟","en":"What is your name?","fr":"Comment tu t'appelles ?","es":"¿Cómo te llamas?","ar":"ما اسمك؟","n":2},{"l":"Smiti ...","a":"سميتي ...","en":"My name is ...","fr":"Je m'appelle ...","es":"Me llamo ...","ar":"اسمي ...","n":2},{"l":"Mtsherfin","a":"متشرفين","en":"Nice to meet you","fr":"Enchanté(e)","es":"Mucho gusto","ar":"تشرفنا","n":2},{"l":"Ma fhemtsh","a":"ما فهمتش","en":"I don't understand","fr":"Je ne comprends pas","es":"No entiendo","ar":"لم أفهم","n":3},{"l":"Wash kathder n-negliziya?","a":"واش كتهدر النڭليزية؟","en":"Do you speak English?","fr":"Vous parlez anglais ?","es":"¿Hablas inglés?","ar":"هل تتكلم الإنجليزية؟","n":2},{"l":"Fin bit l-ma?","a":"فين بيت الما؟","en":"Where is the toilet?","fr":"Où sont les toilettes ?","es":"¿Dónde está el baño?","ar":"أين الحمام؟","n":2},{"l":"Fin kayn ...?","a":"فين كاين ...؟","en":"Where is ...?","fr":"Où est ... ?","es":"¿Dónde está ...?","ar":"أين ...؟","n":1},{"l":"Wakha","a":"واخا","en":"OK / agreed","fr":"D'accord","es":"De acuerdo","ar":"حسنا / موافق","n":3},{"l":"Safi","a":"صافي","en":"That's it / enough / done","fr":"C'est bon / ça suffit","es":"Ya está / basta","ar":"هذا كل شيء / يكفي","n":2}]},{"id":"taxi","t":"Taxi","items":[{"l":"Bghit nemshi l ...","a":"بغيت نمشي ل ...","en":"I want to go to ...","fr":"Je veux aller à ...","es":"Quiero ir a ...","ar":"أريد الذهاب إلى ...","n":2},{"l":"Salam, wash khawi?","a":"سلام واش خاوي؟","en":"Hello, are you free?","fr":"Bonjour, vous êtes libre ?","es":"Hola, ¿está libre?","ar":"مرحبا، هل أنت فارغ؟","n":1},{"l":"Kheddem l-kountour 3afak","a":"خدم الكونتور عافاك","en":"Turn on the meter, please","fr":"Mettez le compteur, s'il vous plaît","es":"Ponga el taxímetro, por favor","ar":"شغل العداد من فضلك","n":3},{"l":"Bshhal ghadi ykon?","a":"بشحال غادي يكون؟","en":"How much will it be?","fr":"Ça fera combien ?","es":"¿Cuánto costará?","ar":"كم سيكون الثمن؟","n":1},{"l":"Wqef hna","a":"وقف هنا","en":"Stop here","fr":"Arrêtez-vous ici","es":"Pare aquí","ar":"توقف هنا","n":2},{"l":"Limen / Lisar / Nichan","a":"ليمن / ليسر / نيشان","en":"Right / Left / Straight","fr":"Droite / Gauche / Tout droit","es":"Derecha / Izquierda / Recto","ar":"يمين / يسار / مستقيم","n":1},{"l":"Ghali bzaf","a":"غالي بزاف","en":"Too expensive","fr":"Trop cher","es":"Demasiado caro","ar":"غالي جدا","n":3}]},{"id":"bargain","t":"Bargaining","items":[{"l":"Bshhal hada?","a":"بشحال هادا؟","en":"How much is this?","fr":"C'est combien ?","es":"¿Cuánto cuesta esto?","ar":"بكم هذا؟","n":2},{"l":"Ghali bzaf","a":"غالي بزاف","en":"Too expensive","fr":"Trop cher","es":"Demasiado caro","ar":"غالي جدا","n":3},{"l":"Nqess shwiya 3afak","a":"نقص شوية عافاك","en":"Lower the price a little, please","fr":"Baissez un peu le prix, s'il vous plaît","es":"Baje un poco el precio, por favor","ar":"خفض السعر قليلا من فضلك","n":2},{"l":"Shi taman mzyan","a":"شي ثمن مزيان","en":"Give me a good price","fr":"Faites-moi un bon prix","es":"Hágame un buen precio","ar":"أعطني ثمنا جيدا","n":1},{"l":"Ash nahowa t-taman l-akhir?","a":"اشناهو الثمن الأخير؟","en":"What is your last price?","fr":"C'est quoi votre dernier prix ?","es":"¿Cuál es su último precio?","ar":"ما هو آخر ثمن؟","n":1},{"l":"Bghit ghir nshouf","a":"بغيت غير نشوف","en":"I'm just looking","fr":"Je regarde seulement","es":"Solo estoy mirando","ar":"أريد أن أنظر فقط","n":1},{"l":"Ma bghitsh","a":"ما بغيتش","en":"I don't want it","fr":"Je n'en veux pas","es":"No lo quiero","ar":"لا أريده","n":2},{"l":"Safi, shukran. Ghadi ndour shwiya","a":"صافي شكرا غادي ندور شوية","en":"OK, thanks. I'll look around","fr":"D'accord, merci. Je vais faire un tour","es":"Vale, gracias. Voy a mirar por ahí","ar":"حسنا شكرا سأتجول قليلا","n":1},{"l":"3ndek s-serf?","a":"عندك الصرف؟","en":"Do you have change?","fr":"Vous avez de la monnaie ?","es":"¿Tiene cambio?","ar":"هل عندك فكة؟","n":1},{"l":"Wakha, ghadi nakhdha","a":"واخا غادي ناخدها","en":"OK, I'll take it","fr":"D'accord, je le prends","es":"Vale, me lo llevo","ar":"حسنا سآخذه","n":1}]},{"id":"food","t":"Eating","items":[{"l":"L-ma 3afak","a":"الما عافاك","en":"Water, please","fr":"De l'eau, s'il vous plaît","es":"Agua, por favor","ar":"ماء من فضلك","n":2},{"l":"Atay bla skkar 3afak","a":"أتاي بلا سكر عافاك","en":"Tea without sugar, please","fr":"Thé sans sucre, s'il vous plaît","es":"Té sin azúcar, por favor","ar":"شاي بدون سكر من فضلك","n":2},{"l":"Ana nabati","a":"أنا نباتي","en":"I am vegetarian","fr":"Je suis végétarien(ne)","es":"Soy vegetariano/a","ar":"أنا نباتي","n":1},{"l":"L-makla bnina","a":"المكلة بنينة","en":"The food is delicious","fr":"Le repas est délicieux","es":"La comida está deliciosa","ar":"الأكل لذيذ","n":1},{"l":"L-hsab 3afak","a":"الحساب عافاك","en":"The bill, please","fr":"L'addition, s'il vous plaît","es":"La cuenta, por favor","ar":"الحساب من فضلك","n":2},{"l":"Saha","a":"صحة","en":"Enjoy your meal / to your health","fr":"Bon appétit / à votre santé","es":"Buen provecho / salud","ar":"بالصحة والهناء","n":2},{"l":"Fiya j-jou3","a":"فيا الجوع","en":"I'm hungry","fr":"J'ai faim","es":"Tengo hambre","ar":"أنا جائع","n":1},{"l":"Fiya l-3tesh","a":"فيا العطش","en":"I'm thirsty","fr":"J'ai soif","es":"Tengo sed","ar":"أنا عطشان","n":1}]},{"id":"help","t":"Help and health","items":[{"l":"3awni 3afak","a":"عاوني عافاك","en":"Help me, please","fr":"Aidez-moi, s'il vous plaît","es":"Ayúdeme, por favor","ar":"ساعدني من فضلك","n":2},{"l":"Khasni nshouf shi tbib daba","a":"خاصني نشوف شي طبيب دابا","en":"I need to see a doctor now","fr":"J'ai besoin d'un médecin tout de suite","es":"Necesito ver a un médico ahora","ar":"أحتاج إلى طبيب الآن","n":1},{"l":"Fin kayn s-sbitar?","a":"فين كاين السبيطار؟","en":"Where is the hospital?","fr":"Où est l'hôpital ?","es":"¿Dónde está el hospital?","ar":"أين المستشفى؟","n":1},{"l":"Wash kayn shi farmasyan hna?","a":"واش كاين شي فارماسيان هنا؟","en":"Is there a pharmacy here?","fr":"Y a-t-il une pharmacie ici ?","es":"¿Hay una farmacia por aquí?","ar":"هل توجد صيدلية هنا؟","n":1},{"l":"3ayyet l-labilans","a":"عيط للابيلانص","en":"Call an ambulance","fr":"Appelez une ambulance","es":"Llame a una ambulancia","ar":"اتصل بالإسعاف","n":1},{"l":"Sreqouni","a":"سرقوني","en":"I've been robbed","fr":"On m'a volé","es":"Me han robado","ar":"لقد سُرقت","n":1},{"l":"Da3 liya l-baspour","a":"ضاع ليا الباسبور","en":"I lost my passport","fr":"J'ai perdu mon passeport","es":"He perdido mi pasaporte","ar":"ضاع جواز سفري","n":1},{"l":"Fiya s-skhana","a":"فيا السخانة","en":"I have a fever","fr":"J'ai de la fièvre","es":"Tengo fiebre","ar":"عندي حمى","n":1},{"l":"Kayderrni rasi","a":"كيضرني راسي","en":"My head hurts","fr":"J'ai mal à la tête","es":"Me duele la cabeza","ar":"رأسي يؤلمني","n":1},{"l":"Kayderrni kershi","a":"كيضرني كرشي","en":"My stomach hurts","fr":"J'ai mal au ventre","es":"Me duele el estómago","ar":"معدتي تؤلمني","n":1}]},{"id":"num","t":"Numbers","items":[{"l":"wahed","a":"واحد","en":"1","fr":"1","es":"1","ar":"1","n":3},{"l":"jouj","a":"جوج","en":"2","fr":"2","es":"2","ar":"2","n":3},{"l":"tlata","a":"تلاتة","en":"3","fr":"3","es":"3","ar":"3","n":3},{"l":"rb3a","a":"ربعة","en":"4","fr":"4","es":"4","ar":"4","n":3},{"l":"khmsa","a":"خمسة","en":"5","fr":"5","es":"5","ar":"5","n":3},{"l":"stta","a":"ستة","en":"6","fr":"6","es":"6","ar":"6","n":3},{"l":"sb3a","a":"سبعة","en":"7","fr":"7","es":"7","ar":"7","n":3},{"l":"tmnya","a":"تمنية","en":"8","fr":"8","es":"8","ar":"8","n":3},{"l":"ts3ud","a":"تسعود","en":"9","fr":"9","es":"9","ar":"9","n":3},{"l":"3shra","a":"عشرة","en":"10","fr":"10","es":"10","ar":"10","n":3},{"l":"3ishrin","a":"عشرين","en":"20","fr":"20","es":"20","ar":"20","n":2},{"l":"khamsin","a":"خمسين","en":"50","fr":"50","es":"50","ar":"50","n":1},{"l":"mya","a":"مية","en":"100","fr":"100","es":"100","ar":"100","n":2},{"l":"myatayn","a":"ميتين","en":"200","fr":"200","es":"200","ar":"200","n":1},{"l":"khams mya","a":"خمس مية","en":"500","fr":"500","es":"500","ar":"500","n":1},{"l":"alf","a":"ألف","en":"1000","fr":"1000","es":"1000","ar":"1000","n":1}]},{"id":"days","t":"Days","items":[{"l":"Tnin","a":"تنين","en":"Monday","fr":"Lundi","es":"Lunes","ar":"الاثنين","n":1},{"l":"Tlat","a":"تلات","en":"Tuesday","fr":"Mardi","es":"Martes","ar":"الثلاثاء","n":1},{"l":"Larb3a","a":"لاربعا","en":"Wednesday","fr":"Mercredi","es":"Miércoles","ar":"الأربعاء","n":1},{"l":"Lkhmis","a":"لخميس","en":"Thursday","fr":"Jeudi","es":"Jueves","ar":"الخميس","n":1},{"l":"Jem3a","a":"جمعة","en":"Friday","fr":"Vendredi","es":"Viernes","ar":"الجمعة","n":1},{"l":"Sebt","a":"سبت","en":"Saturday","fr":"Samedi","es":"Sábado","ar":"السبت","n":1},{"l":"L7edd","a":"لحد","en":"Sunday","fr":"Dimanche","es":"Domingo","ar":"الأحد","n":1}]}],"i18n":{"fr":{"Darija phrasebook":"Guide de darija","Offline phrases with sources":"Expressions hors ligne avec sources","Search phrases":"Rechercher une expression","All":"Tout","Basics":"Bases","Taxi":"Taxi","Bargaining":"Marchandage","Eating":"Repas","Help and health":"Aide et santé","Numbers":"Chiffres","Days":"Jours","Checked in 2 or more sources":"Vérifié dans 2 sources ou plus","Single source, less certain":"Une seule source, moins sûr","No phrase matches your search.":"Aucune expression ne correspond à votre recherche.","Spelling varies between regions and sources. Phrases were written by the author from public sources and not checked by a native speaker. Meanings in your language are machine-translated.":"L'orthographe varie selon les régions et les sources. Les expressions ont été écrites par l'auteur à partir de sources publiques et n'ont pas été vérifiées par un locuteur natif. Les traductions sont automatiques.","Sources: Wikivoyage Moroccan Arabic phrasebook (CC BY-SA), moroccomag.com phrasebook, dailydarija.com bargaining guide, darijamarocain.com taxi guide.":"Sources : guide de conversation en arabe marocain de Wikivoyage (CC BY-SA), moroccomag.com, guide de marchandage de dailydarija.com, guide du taxi de darijamarocain.com.","Trip budget":"Budget du voyage","Add your own numbers":"Ajoutez vos propres chiffres","Travellers":"Voyageurs","Stay per night (MAD, whole room)":"Hébergement par nuit (MAD, chambre entière)","Food per person per day (MAD)":"Repas par personne et par jour (MAD)","Transport per day (MAD, total)":"Transport par jour (MAD, total)","Activities and tickets per person per day (MAD)":"Activités et billets par personne et par jour (MAD)","Other costs for the whole trip (MAD)":"Autres frais pour tout le voyage (MAD)","Total in dirham":"Total en dirhams","Per person per day":"Par personne et par jour","Converted with your rates from the Currency converter. Not live.":"Converti avec vos taux du convertisseur de devises. Pas en direct.","The app does not guess prices. Type your own figures. The Prices page lists sourced fares and ticket costs to help you.":"L'application ne devine pas les prix. Saisissez vos propres chiffres. La page Prix liste des tarifs sourcés pour vous aider.","Plan what you expect to spend":"Prévoyez ce que vous comptez dépenser","Plan my day":"Planifier ma journée","Pick a city and the number of days. The plan comes from the sights list and its visit-time estimates.":"Choisissez une ville et le nombre de jours. Le plan vient de la liste des sites et de leurs durées de visite estimées.","City":"Ville","Day %s":"Jour %s","About %s of sightseeing, without travel time":"Environ %s de visite, sans le trajet","Visit times are estimates from the guide data. Opening hours and travel between places are not included. Check opening hours before you go.":"Les durées sont des estimations. Les horaires d'ouverture et les trajets ne sont pas inclus. Vérifiez les horaires avant d'y aller.","Fair prices (approximate)":"Prix corrects (approximatifs)","Prices change. Use these as a guide, not a quote. Sources are shown under each price.":"Les prix changent. Prenez-les comme repère, pas comme devis. Les sources sont indiquées sous chaque prix.","Verified":"Vérifié","Range, approximate":"Fourchette, approximatif","Estimate, unverified":"Estimation, non vérifié","Common scams in Morocco":"Arnaques courantes au Maroc","Order in Darija":"Commander en darija","Phrases for ordering food and agreeing a price.":"Expressions pour commander et s'entendre sur un prix.","No sights listed for this city yet.":"Aucun site listé pour cette ville.","Not enough sights for more days. Showing %s.":"Pas assez de sites pour plus de jours. Affichage de %s.","Not checked":"Non vérifié","Day by day from the sights list":"Jour par jour à partir des sites","1 day":"1 jour","1 place":"1 lieu"},"es":{"Darija phrasebook":"Guía de darija","Offline phrases with sources":"Frases sin conexión con fuentes","Search phrases":"Buscar frases","All":"Todo","Basics":"Básico","Taxi":"Taxi","Bargaining":"Regateo","Eating":"Comer","Help and health":"Ayuda y salud","Numbers":"Números","Days":"Días","Checked in 2 or more sources":"Comprobado en 2 fuentes o más","Single source, less certain":"Una sola fuente, menos seguro","No phrase matches your search.":"Ninguna frase coincide con tu búsqueda.","Spelling varies between regions and sources. Phrases were written by the author from public sources and not checked by a native speaker. Meanings in your language are machine-translated.":"La ortografía varía según la región y la fuente. Las frases las escribió el autor a partir de fuentes públicas y no las ha revisado un hablante nativo. Las traducciones son automáticas.","Sources: Wikivoyage Moroccan Arabic phrasebook (CC BY-SA), moroccomag.com phrasebook, dailydarija.com bargaining guide, darijamarocain.com taxi guide.":"Fuentes: guía de conversación de árabe marroquí de Wikivoyage (CC BY-SA), moroccomag.com, guía de regateo de dailydarija.com, guía de taxi de darijamarocain.com.","Trip budget":"Presupuesto del viaje","Add your own numbers":"Añade tus propias cifras","Travellers":"Viajeros","Stay per night (MAD, whole room)":"Alojamiento por noche (MAD, habitación entera)","Food per person per day (MAD)":"Comida por persona y día (MAD)","Transport per day (MAD, total)":"Transporte por día (MAD, total)","Activities and tickets per person per day (MAD)":"Actividades y entradas por persona y día (MAD)","Other costs for the whole trip (MAD)":"Otros gastos de todo el viaje (MAD)","Total in dirham":"Total en dírhams","Per person per day":"Por persona y día","Converted with your rates from the Currency converter. Not live.":"Convertido con tus tipos del conversor de divisas. No en vivo.","The app does not guess prices. Type your own figures. The Prices page lists sourced fares and ticket costs to help you.":"La app no adivina precios. Escribe tus propias cifras. La página de Precios muestra tarifas con fuentes para ayudarte.","Plan what you expect to spend":"Planifica lo que piensas gastar","Plan my day":"Planificar mi día","Pick a city and the number of days. The plan comes from the sights list and its visit-time estimates.":"Elige una ciudad y los días. El plan sale de la lista de lugares y sus tiempos de visita estimados.","City":"Ciudad","Day %s":"Día %s","About %s of sightseeing, without travel time":"Unos %s de visitas, sin contar los traslados","Visit times are estimates from the guide data. Opening hours and travel between places are not included. Check opening hours before you go.":"Los tiempos son estimaciones. No incluyen horarios de apertura ni traslados. Comprueba los horarios antes de ir.","Fair prices (approximate)":"Precios justos (aproximados)","Prices change. Use these as a guide, not a quote. Sources are shown under each price.":"Los precios cambian. Úsalos como guía, no como presupuesto. Las fuentes aparecen bajo cada precio.","Verified":"Verificado","Range, approximate":"Rango, aproximado","Estimate, unverified":"Estimación, sin verificar","Common scams in Morocco":"Estafas comunes en Marruecos","Order in Darija":"Pedir en darija","Phrases for ordering food and agreeing a price.":"Frases para pedir comida y acordar un precio.","No sights listed for this city yet.":"Aún no hay lugares para esta ciudad.","Not enough sights for more days. Showing %s.":"No hay lugares para más días. Se muestran %s.","Not checked":"Sin verificar","Day by day from the sights list":"Día a día según la lista de lugares","1 day":"1 día","1 place":"1 lugar"},"ar":{"Darija phrasebook":"دليل الدارجة","Offline phrases with sources":"عبارات بدون إنترنت مع المصادر","Search phrases":"ابحث عن عبارة","All":"الكل","Basics":"أساسيات","Taxi":"سيارة أجرة","Bargaining":"المساومة","Eating":"الأكل","Help and health":"المساعدة والصحة","Numbers":"الأرقام","Days":"الأيام","Checked in 2 or more sources":"تم التحقق في مصدرين أو أكثر","Single source, less certain":"مصدر واحد، أقل تأكيدا","No phrase matches your search.":"لا توجد عبارة مطابقة لبحثك.","Spelling varies between regions and sources. Phrases were written by the author from public sources and not checked by a native speaker. Meanings in your language are machine-translated.":"يختلف الإملاء بين المناطق والمصادر. كتب المؤلف العبارات من مصادر عامة ولم يراجعها متحدث أصلي. المعاني بلغتك مترجمة آليا.","Sources: Wikivoyage Moroccan Arabic phrasebook (CC BY-SA), moroccomag.com phrasebook, dailydarija.com bargaining guide, darijamarocain.com taxi guide.":"المصادر: دليل العبارات المغربي في ويكي سفر (CC BY-SA) وموقع moroccomag.com ودليل المساومة في dailydarija.com ودليل سيارة الأجرة في darijamarocain.com.","Trip budget":"ميزانية الرحلة","Add your own numbers":"أضف أرقامك الخاصة","Travellers":"المسافرون","Stay per night (MAD, whole room)":"الإقامة لكل ليلة (درهم، الغرفة كاملة)","Food per person per day (MAD)":"الأكل للشخص في اليوم (درهم)","Transport per day (MAD, total)":"النقل في اليوم (درهم، المجموع)","Activities and tickets per person per day (MAD)":"الأنشطة والتذاكر للشخص في اليوم (درهم)","Other costs for the whole trip (MAD)":"تكاليف أخرى للرحلة كلها (درهم)","Total in dirham":"المجموع بالدرهم","Per person per day":"للشخص في اليوم","Converted with your rates from the Currency converter. Not live.":"محول بأسعارك من محول العملات. ليس مباشرا.","The app does not guess prices. Type your own figures. The Prices page lists sourced fares and ticket costs to help you.":"لا يخمن التطبيق الأسعار. اكتب أرقامك. تعرض صفحة الأسعار أسعارا موثقة لمساعدتك.","Plan what you expect to spend":"خطط لما تتوقع إنفاقه","Plan my day":"خطط ليومي","Pick a city and the number of days. The plan comes from the sights list and its visit-time estimates.":"اختر مدينة وعدد الأيام. الخطة مبنية على قائمة المعالم ومدة الزيارة التقديرية.","City":"المدينة","Day %s":"اليوم %s","About %s of sightseeing, without travel time":"حوالي %s من الزيارات، دون وقت التنقل","Visit times are estimates from the guide data. Opening hours and travel between places are not included. Check opening hours before you go.":"المدد تقديرية. لا تشمل ساعات الفتح ولا التنقل بين الأماكن. تحقق من ساعات الفتح قبل الذهاب.","Fair prices (approximate)":"أسعار عادلة (تقريبية)","Prices change. Use these as a guide, not a quote. Sources are shown under each price.":"الأسعار تتغير. استعملها كمرجع لا كعرض سعر. المصادر تحت كل سعر.","Verified":"مؤكد","Range, approximate":"نطاق تقريبي","Estimate, unverified":"تقدير غير مؤكد","Common scams in Morocco":"احتيالات شائعة في المغرب","Order in Darija":"اطلب بالدارجة","Phrases for ordering food and agreeing a price.":"عبارات لطلب الطعام والاتفاق على السعر.","No sights listed for this city yet.":"لا توجد معالم مدرجة لهذه المدينة بعد.","Not enough sights for more days. Showing %s.":"لا توجد معالم كافية لأيام أكثر. المعروض %s.","Not checked":"غير مؤكد","Day by day from the sights list":"يوما بيوم من قائمة المعالم","1 day":"يوم واحد","1 place":"مكان واحد"}}}
